@startuml arxiv-download
!theme blueprint
title ArXiv Download & Extraction Process

start

:downloadArxivSource() called;
:Construct URL\narxiv.org/e-print/{id};
:Progress Update\nDOWNLOAD_SOURCE\nIN_PROGRESS;

:HTTP Fetch\nArXiv API;

if (Response OK?) then (yes)
  :Create Directory\n./tmp/{arxivId}/;
  :Write Tarball\nsource.tar.gz;
  :Progress Update\nDOWNLOAD_SOURCE\nCOMPLETED;
else (no)
  :Throw Error\nHTTP Status Not OK;
  stop
endif

:extractTarball() called;
:Open Tarball\nsource.tar.gz;
:Create DecompressionStream\ngzip;
:Create UntarStream\nParse tar entries;

repeat
  :Extract entry;
  :Create directories;
  :Write file to\n./tmp/{arxivId}/latex/;
  :Progress Update\nEXTRACT_TARBALL\nPer-file progress;
repeat while (More entries?)

:Cleanup\nRemove source.tar.gz;
:Progress Update\nEXTRACT_TARBALL\nCOMPLETED;

stop

note right
  **Key Features:**
  • Streaming decompression
    for memory efficiency
  • Path normalization
    for security
  • Real-time progress updates
  • Automatic cleanup
  • Comprehensive error handling
end note

floating note left : ArXiv API\nFetch Source
floating note right : Local Storage\n./tmp/{arxivId}/

@enduml